          <p class="net76-help" data-en="These are source categories to consult, not claimed research findings. No independent test reviews have been retrieved for this personalised session." data-de="Dies sind empfohlene Quellenkategorien, keine behaupteten Forschungsergebnisse. Für diese Sitzung wurden keine unabhängigen Tests abgerufen.">These are source categories to consult, not claimed research findings. No independent test reviews have been retrieved for this personalised session.</p>
          <div class="net76-source-list">
            <article><span>01</span><div><strong data-en="Manufacturer or provider" data-de="Hersteller oder Anbieter">Manufacturer or provider</strong><p data-en="Check the exact plan, model, specification, firmware policy and terms." data-de="Genauen Tarif, Modell, Spezifikation, Firmwarepflege und Vertragsbedingungen prüfen.">Check the exact plan, model, specification, firmware policy and terms.</p></div></article>
            <article><span>02</span><div><strong data-en="Independent testing" data-de="Unabhängige Tests">Independent testing</strong><p data-en="Seek attributed, date-stamped hands-on tests for the exact product or provider; ONOCRA does not run lab tests." data-de="Nach datierten Praxistests zum konkreten Produkt oder Anbieter mit klarer Quellenangabe suchen; ONOCRA betreibt kein Testlabor.">Seek attributed, date-stamped hands-on tests for the exact product or provider; ONOCRA does not run lab tests.</p></div></article>
            <article><span>03</span><div><strong data-en="Standards and certification" data-de="Standards und Zertifizierung">Standards and certification</strong><p id="net76-standards"></p></div></article>
            <article><span>04</span><div><strong data-en="Regional authority and local checks" data-de="Behörden und Prüfung vor Ort">Regional authority and local checks</strong><p id="net76-authority-desc"></p><a id="net76-authority" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://broadbandmap.fcc.gov/home">Official country source ↗</a></div></article>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="net76-box net76-next-box" aria-labelledby="net76-next-heading">
          <h2 id="net76-next-heading"><span class="net76-num">06</span> <span data-en="What to do next" data-de="Ihre nächsten Schritte">What to do next</span></h2>
          <p class="net76-help" data-en="Resolve the unknowns before buying or switching." data-de="Klären Sie die offenen Punkte vor Kauf oder Wechsel.">Resolve the unknowns before buying or switching.</p>
          <ol id="net76-next-steps" class="net76-next-steps"></ol>
          <div class="net76-method"><strong data-en="How ONOCRA evaluates" data-de="So bewertet ONOCRA">How ONOCRA evaluates</strong><p data-en="Manufacturer disclosures, standards, independently published evidence when available, and your stated priorities are treated separately. No laboratory testing, invented scores or financial offers are implied. Your browser generates this summary from your selections." data-de="Herstellerangaben, Standards, unabhängige Veröffentlichungen (falls verfügbar) und Ihre Prioritäten werden getrennt betrachtet. Keine eigenen Labortests, erfundenen Noten oder Finanzangebote. Ihr Browser erzeugt dieses Fazit aus Ihren Angaben.">Manufacturer disclosures, standards, independently published evidence when available, and your stated priorities are treated separately. No laboratory testing, invented scores or financial offers are implied. Your browser generates this summary from your selections.</p></div>
        </section>
